    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're supposed to say that stuff but it doesnt feel real. it just feels like i actually broke something that can't be fixed. like some people are just born with this darkness in them and no matter how much i try to be \"good\" or \"helpful\" i just end up hurting the people i care about. how am i supposed to live with that? knowing i'm just a net negative to everyone i meet?\nwouldwouldwouldnt it be more logical if just just admit that",
